cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite the associated article below."
title: "turboid-interactome"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible R pipeline for TurboID / BioID proximity-labeling proteomics,
  from a raw MaxQuant proteinGroups.txt through filtering, normalization, a
  tiered imputation strategy, factorial limma modeling, evidence-tiered
  candidate classification, and GO / pathway enrichment. Demonstrated on the
  IRE1a / IRE1b interactome in HMC-1.2 cells (PRIDE PXD047343).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmed
    given-names: Nabil
repository-code: "https://github.com/NabilAhmed9/turboid-interactome"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - TurboID
  - BioID
  - proximity labeling
  - proteomics
  - IRE1
  - limma
